    romantic: `In romance, Pluto in Scorpio brings obsessive total merger, transformation through sexual and emotional intensity, and power dynamics that are profound and potentially consuming. This person experiences romance as complete union or not at all, needs the relationship to involve ongoing transformation, and sexuality is experienced as path to transcendence and power. The challenge is possessiveness and jealousy, or cycles of death and rebirth that can be destructive. The partner who works well with Pluto in Scorpio can handle absolute intensity and total honesty, commits completely, and participates in ongoing transformation through facing shadow together. Partnerships that honor this placement involve profound sexual and psychological intimacy, transform continuously through crisis and regeneration, and understand that this person's intensity is their power and their gift.`,
